spy":0.0524}}],"quotes":[{"c":"TGTX 2019 Q2","e":"tgtx","d":"2019-08-09","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Sean A. Power","x":"We have continued to streamline our spending and focus resources on our critical clinical programs.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/08/09/tg-therapeutics-inc-tgtx-q2-2019-earnings-call-tra.aspx"},{"c":"TGTX 2019 Q4","e":"tgtx","d":"2020-03-03","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Michael S. Weiss","x":"…-- and just to go back, and we've talked about this for quite some time, where we were saying, look, our expectation is if the powering is correct, we should have these events in a certain timeframe and that's why we were expecting the events in the timeframe which we had just passed through.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/03/03/tg-therapeutics-inc-tgtx-q4-2019-earnings-call-tra.aspx"},{"c":"TGTX 2025 Q3","e":"tgtx","d":"2025-11-03","l":"streaming","r":"management","s":"Adam Waldman","x":"Complementing our strategic growth, Q3 also marked the first full quarter of our national television campaign, supported by expanded digital streaming and social media initiatives.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/11/27/tg-therapeutics-tgtx-q3-2025-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"TGTX 2025 Q3","e":"tgtx","d":"2025-11-03","l":"streaming","r":"management","s":"Adam Waldman","x":"Obviously, we're going to continue to monitor and see how our direct-to-consumer efforts has an effect and impact on overall patient conversions on to treatment and whether that's continuing to work.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/11/27/tg-therapeutics-tgtx-q3-2025-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"TGTX 2025 Q3","e":"tgtx","d":"2025-11-03","l":"dtc","r":"management","s":"Adam Waldman","x":"We continue to expect market share gains and as we continue to expand our field force and with the DTC efforts that we're having.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/11/27/tg-therapeutics-tgtx-q3-2025-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"TGTX 2025 Q3","e":"tgtx","d":"2025-11-03","l":"dtc","r":"management","s":"Adam Waldman","x":"And I think the DTC investments, as I said, remains to be seen.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/11/27/tg-therapeutics-tgtx-q3-2025-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"TGTX 2025 Q4","e":"tgtx","d":"2026-02-26","l":"streaming","r":"management","s":"Adam Waldman","x":"We have invested meaningfully in field expansion and direct-to-consumer initiatives to support the next phase of growth.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/02/26/tg-therapeutics-tgtx-q4-2025-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"TGTX 2025 Q4","e":"tgtx","d":"2026-02-26","l":"dtc","r":"management","s":"Adam Waldman","x":"It could very well be our DTC efforts, although hard to single out a single factor here.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/02/26/tg-therapeutics-tgtx-q4-2025-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"TGTX 2025 Q4","e":"tgtx","d":"2026-02-26","l":"dtc","r":"management","s":"Michael Weiss","x":"And then the second part of the question was early metrics on DTC.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/02/26/tg-therapeutics-tgtx-q4-2025-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"TGTX 2025 Q4","e":"tgtx","d":"2026-02-26","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Adam Waldman","x":"Taken together, the strength of demand and continued share expansion gives us confidence in our reaffirmed guidance and our ability to drive meaningful growth in 2026.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/02/26/tg-therapeutics-tgtx-q4-2025-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"TGTX 2026 Q1","e":"tgtx","d":"2026-05-06","l":"dtc","r":"management","s":"Adam Waldman","x":"And our DTC efforts are helping to increase patient awareness with more patients entering the office already informed about BRIUMVI.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/05/06/tg-therapeutics-tgtx-q1-2026-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"TGTX 2026 Q1","e":"tgtx","d":"2026-05-06","l":"dtc","r":"management","s":"Adam Waldman","x":"As far as DTC, we're encouraged.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/05/06/tg-therapeutics-tgtx-q1-2026-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"TGTX 2026 Q1","e":"tgtx","d":"2026-05-06","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Adam Waldman","x":"Our execution is translating into durable, increasingly predictable growth, and we're significantly raising our 2026 outlook.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/05/06/tg-therapeutics-tgtx-q1-2026-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"TGTX 2026 Q2","e":"tgtx","d":"2026-08-03","l":"streaming","r":"management","s":"Adam Waldman","x":"Our field organization, market access capabilities, patient support services and direct-to-consumer investments continue to make BRIUMVI easier to prescribe, easier to access and easier to remain on.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/08/10/tg-therapeutics-tgtx-q2-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"TGTX 2026 Q2","e":"tgtx","d":"2026-08-03","l":"streaming","r":"management","s":"Adam Waldman","x":"We've also been encouraged by the early response to our direct-to-consumer campaign and plan to expand those efforts during the second half of the year.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/08/10/tg-therapeutics-tgtx-q2-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"TGTX 2026 Q2","e":"tgtx","d":"2026-08-03","l":"dtc","r":"management","s":"Sean Power","x":"In terms of expenses, we expect full year OpEx of $350 million to $400 million, excluding stock-based compensation, reflecting continued investment in our commercial organization and expanded DTC efforts.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/08/10/tg-therapeutics-tgtx-q2-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"TGTX 2026 Q2","e":"tgtx","d":"2026-08-03","l":"dtc","r":"management","s":"Adam Waldman","x":"As I said in my remarks, I think the response to wha